A short walk from the historic Port Lympne to the seafront, this beautifully furnished and spacious townhouse will suit families of four for an enjoyable holiday on the sea-front of White Cliffs of Dover. Set in an area of outstanding beauty within the Ashdown Forest of Kent, Leighton’s is an extremely convenient location for discovering a variety of local attractions as well as visiting Dover Castle, the Tower of London, the House of Lords and St Margaret’s Church to name but a few. A number of local shops are situated close to the location while the nearby Ashdown Forest Railway is also accessible at a short drive away. The town of Tunbridge Wells is just five miles away where further local amenities include a variety of eating and drinking establishments as well as plenty of retail therapy to enjoy including the famous High St.
Accommodation: This beautifully furnished two-bedroom detached townhouse (sleeps four) offers stylish accommodation comprising of an open-plan living room with a comfortable pull out sofa

